#35300
Middle of the Lake~
   The crystal, blue waters splash in choppy waves all about you.  The
breeze is cool as it blows over the lake.  The hypnotic lapping of the
waves, provides an aura of tranquility unlike any other in the realm.
The shores can be seen in the distance, just below the horizon - some
lined with trees, some lined with craggy hills, some lined with laketowns.
